{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_ADB","canonical_person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_ADB","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["9wm_vgh_vz1_ADB"],"persons":[{"id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_AD","label":"沈君高（字季高，諡祁子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"君高","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0153","c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0005","c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0079","c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0195"]},{"surface":"季高","mention_ids":["c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0009"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004:m0153","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p004","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0005","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0009","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"季高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0079","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"},{"mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0195","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","quote":"君高"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"沈君高（字季高，諡祁子），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_A","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-chen023-jungao-brother"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","quote":"君理第六弟君高，字季高，少知名，性剛直，有吏能。以家門外戚，早居清顯，歷太子舍人、洗馬、中舍人、高宗司空府從事中郎、廷尉卿。太建元年，東境大水，百姓飢弊，乃以君高為貞威將軍、吳令。尋除太子中庶子、尚書吏部郎、衛尉卿。出為宣遠將軍、平南長沙王長史、南海太守，行廣州事。以女為王妃，固辭不行，復為衛尉卿。八年，詔授持節、都督廣等十八州諸軍事、寧遠將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史。嶺南俚、獠世相攻伐，君高本文吏，無武幹，推心撫御，甚得民和。十年，卒于官，時年四十七。贈散騎常侍，諡曰祁子。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:m0000","source_term":"君理第六弟君高","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-jungao-brother"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001","quote":"沈君理字仲倫，吳興人也。祖僧畟，梁左民尚書。父巡，素與高祖相善，梁太清中為東陽太守。侯景平後，元帝徵為少府卿。荊州陷，蕭詧署金紫光祿大夫。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p001:m0023","source_term":"父巡","source_assertion_id":"a-chen023-junli-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"依本傳兄弟明文與君理父巡兩則原句暫接父系。"}},{"id":"9wm_vgh_vz1_ADB","label":"沈氏（沈君高女，長沙王妃）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","quote":"女","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:r0134"},{"work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-023","chapter_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete","source_id":"s-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete-ws1514496","paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006","quote":"王妃","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-chenshu-023-shenjunli-complete:p006:r0136"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":